 dies, from any live state" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;arcSize=24;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=5;strokeColor=light-dark(#AEAEB2,#8E8E93);strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontColor=light-dark(#48484A,#D1D1D6);labelBackgroundColor=light-dark(#F2F2F7,#1C1C1E);html=0;fontFamily=Instrument Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss2%3Ffamily%3DInstrument%2BSans%3Awght%40400%3B600;startArrow=oval;startFill=1;startSize=5;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;overflow=fill;" edge="1" target="FC" parent="1"><mxGeometry height="13" width="219" x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1588" y="620" as="sourcePoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c80" value="A job waits as PENDING until a controller claims it, is STARTING while its cluster launches, and RUNNING once the job is submitted; a lost cluster, or a failure with restarts left, sends it to RECOVERING until it is relaunched." style="html=0;fontFamily=Instrument Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss2%3Ffamily%3DInstrument%2BSans%3Awght%40400%3B600;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=light-dark(#6E6E73,#98989F);" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="696" width="1295" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c81" value="With no resources it goes back to PENDING while it backs off, then returns to STARTING or RECOVERING; failing prechecks, the retry limit, a failed setup, or failing code with no restarts left end it." style="html=0;fontFamily=Instrument Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss2%3Ffamily%3DInstrument%2BSans%3Awght%40400%3B600;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=light-dark(#6E6E73,#98989F);" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="718" width="1148" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c82" value="You can cancel it from any live state, and it is CANCELLED once its cluster is cleaned up; a controller that errs or dies ends it as FAILED_CONTROLLER." style="html=0;fontFamily=Instrument Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss2%3Ffamily%3DInstrument%2BSans%3Awght%40400%3B600;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=light-dark(#6E6E73,#98989F);" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="740" width="886" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c83" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=light-dark(#FFFFFF,#2C2C2E);strokeColor=light-dark(#D1D1D6,#3A3A3C);" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="784" width="28" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c84" value="a live status" style="html=0;fontFamily=Instrument Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss2%3Ffamily%3DInstrument%2BSans%3Awght%40400%3B600;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=light-dark(#6E6E73,#98989F);" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="56" y="784" width="68" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c85" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=light-dark(#FFFFFF,#2C2C2E);strokeColor=light-dark(#34C759,#30D158);strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="152" y="784" width="28" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c86" value="ends, the job succeeded" style="html=0;fontFamily=Instrument Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss2%3Ffamily%3DInstrument%2BSans%3Awght%40400%3B600;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=light-dark(#6E6E73,#98989F);" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="188" y="784" width="137" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c87" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=light-dark(#FFFFFF,#2C2C2E);strokeColor=light-dark(#FF3B30,#FF453A);strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="353" y="784" width="28" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c88" value="ends without success" style="html=0;f